WEBVTT

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:08.700
I'm now in my second year of high school and it's almost the end of May,

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.280
but the girl who said to me "Let's be friends," that is, Edogawa-san,

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.620
hasn't actually spent any time with me as a friend.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:17.870
However,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.750
the reason behind that was one major issue.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.670
Edogawa-san had a secret she couldn't tell anyone.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.220
Deep down, she wanted to be my friend,

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.260
but feared that secret might be revealed

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:32.890
and couldn't bring herself to open up to me.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:33.470
Despite this,

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:38.940
I finally stumbled upon her secret.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.830
N-No, this is...

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:00.290
It's not that I'm a man.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.330
What would be the best way to explain it?

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:02.960
Um, you could say...

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:08.720
I have a body that sprouts a penis from time to time!

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.180
Now that we have a secret we share between us,

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:16.180
as her friend and as her buddy,

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:19.560
I must care for her and do what I can to protect her.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:00.910
A penis... A penis...

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.160
What's the matter, Sasami-san?

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.170
You sound like all your brain cells underwent necrosis.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:06.670
Huh?

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:10.750
Oh, just something that would worry any girl my age.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:13.970
That aside, I'm now in my second year here,

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.930
so why aren't I making more friends?

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:19.800
I was supposed to be such a bright and cheerful person that people couldn't stay away

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.350
and make a bunch of friends!

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:23.930
But I guess not.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.600
What are you doing?

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:29.020
My hands are tired.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.980
I cannot believe I have to use chopsticks to feed myself.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.150
It is such a nuisance.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:36.990
Please don't copy my manner of speech.

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:39.410
You should feed yourself.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:43.910
But when someone feeds me, I feel like I'm loved!

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:46.000
You'll get no love from me.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.710
I'm just looking after you because you're so helpless.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:49.790
You're so mean!

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.670
Don't you know how much I love you!

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:57.260
Please don't shout things that could be the cause of misunderstandings!

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:00.510
You never desert me. I love you for that.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.310
I'll feed you, too.

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:05.140
Didn't you say your hands were tired?

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:07.140
Just this once, okay?

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:13.150
Despite saying that, Kagami was too kind to refuse me,

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.480
and as she let herself get carried away,

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.740
the food soon passed directly
between our barely parted lips.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.490
What a diabolical plan!

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.820
Sasami-san, you scare me sometimes.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:25.250
So the two of them really <i>are</i> going out!

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.750
I bet they're not interested in guys at all!

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:31.500
Probably not interested in girls who aren't <i>that way</i>, either.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.920
Kneel before me, peasants!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:41.390
Oh, that wasn't what I was going to say.

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:43.680
It was "Good day, everyone!"

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:46.680
You're all sitting there doing nothing like a bunch of idiots.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:53.690
"First Annual Class 2-L Bonding Event."

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:58.070
"Three Days and Two Nights at
the Kuzuryuu Shrine, at a Resort of Love"?

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.530
I know this is sudden,

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:01.570
but we'll be going on a trip over the holidays.

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:05.080
It will be all-you-can-eat and drink at a refreshing resort!

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.080
And it will be completely free!

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.370
The more the merrier,

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.620
so I'm inviting all of you!

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:15.250
I'm inviting you solely so you peasants can truly comprehend

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:18.880
how fortunate you are to be in the same class as me.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.380
I-It's not like I care if you come,

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.640
but since you'll have nothing to do anyway, attendance is mandatory!

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:24.890
You're all coming. Got it?

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:30.890
This will be the only such chance in your less than fortunate lives!

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:32.520
So fall down and despair!

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.320
We're in despair!

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.650
Now, grab your chance, peasants!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.530
Come on, join in the fun!

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.370
You haven't told anyone, have you?

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.580
Huh? No.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:49.370
If you tell anyone, I'll kill you.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:52.120
Hey, Edogawa-san...

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:52.750
What is it?

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:55.500
Can I come on that trip too?

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.630
Of course!

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:57.250
Or rather...

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:59.760
If you don't come, I'll kill you.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.010
You have a cold.

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:04.510
You'll have to miss the bonding event.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.140
No.

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.220
Edogawa-san will kill me.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.810
You can't go on a trip with the fever you've got!

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.810
No matter how much you hate me for it,

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:15.270
I'm not going to let you go outside today!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.650
Oh, if you need anything, either push this button

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.900
or recite the magic spell,
"Onii-chan, I love you! I love you so much!"

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.660
I don't have the energy for that.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:27.580
Then get some rest, Sasami-san.

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.040
Onii-chan, you jerk.

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.160
Yay, yay!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.960
Morning, Mamarin!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:35.920
How are you?

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:36.750
Tama?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.210
How come you're here?

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.550
Both my sisters are out.

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:43.010
Tsurugi-nee told me to stay here while they're gone!

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:44.840
That bitch...

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:47.760
She's making me babysit Tama while she goes off on a trip.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.350
A trip?!

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:51.470
I wanna go on a trip too!

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:54.390
Mamarin, let's go on a trip together!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.350
I want to go, too.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.520
A trip with you...

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.530
Oh yeah, that's what I can do!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:05.360
Basically, this will solve everything.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.030
Got it?

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.030
Y-Yeah.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:10.580
You don't sound very sure.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.160
Just don't move, okay?

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:19.710
That tickles!

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:23.590
Yamato is the heart of my country...

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:27.590
secluded in the mountains within mountains, the blue-green hedges in array.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.600
How beautiful is Yamato!

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:39.110
Oh? I turned into Mamarin?

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:44.070
With that kiss, I linked a thread of my spiritual power to the meridian on your forehead.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:47.700
Through that thread, I can control your actions.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.320
Like piloting a super robot.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.080
I'm a super robot?

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:57.330
From this room, I can detect
everything you see, hear, or feel.

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:00.210
You should go to the bonding event in my place.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:02.210
Got it! I'll do my best!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:05.970
Okay then, here we go!

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:11.470
Did you call me, Sasami-san?

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:13.850
You need my love, don't you?

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:16.390
Where should I spread my love on you?

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:21.310
Now, show me what part of you aches with love for me, My Sister!

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:22.770
Ahh!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.740
Let my sentences take form and get through to her!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.490
Tama, can you see this?

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:36.290
Um, Mamarin, well...

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:36.750
There!

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.250
Tama joined the chat room.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:42.000
Dekita?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.380
Can't you type in Japanese?

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:44.500
Did it work?

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.760
You still left your name like that.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.260
Now, do as I tell you.

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:51.010
Okay, I'll do my best!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:53.010
What's wrong, Sasami-san?

00:08:53.510 --> 00:09:02.020
Tell him "Um, Onii-chan, my cold's gone now."

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:06.110
Leave off the "tell him" part!

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:07.650
Show him how full of energy you are!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.150
Look! I'm so full of energy!

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.780
Yes, almost unnaturally so.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.910
Beg him and tell him you want to go on the trip.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:18.160
So, Onii-chan, can I go on the trip?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.120
Please, Onii-chan!

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:20.670
Mamarin—

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:24.840
I mean, <i>I</i> was really looking forward to it!

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.050
So please, grant her wish.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.670
I mean, grant <i>my</i> wish!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.180
But...

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:33.430
I can, can't I, Onii-chan?

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:36.430
You're so kind. I love you!

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.140
What's happened to you, Sasami-san?!

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:42.520
You're suddenly speaking so frankly about how you really feel.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.190
It's like shooting an arrow through my heart!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.440
Oh, you must want to marry me!

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:50.570
I've already got a marriage registration form all filled in! All you have to do is sign!

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:53.200
The law is the only thing that stands in our way!

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:56.700
Marriage? Sure I'll marry you, Onii-chan!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.830
Huh? Whenever I usually say something like this,

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:03.830
you'd deliver a body blow or try to strangle me.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:04.880
Am I dreaming?

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:07.840
No, even if this is a dream, this is my Happy End!

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:09.130
Or rather, my True End!

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:11.220
I can die a happy man!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:13.340
We can't love each other if you're dead!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.550
Stay with me, then we can get all lovey-dovey!

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.350
What are you saying?!

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:21.600
Just get out of the house already!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.980
I'll do my very bestest!

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:27.320
All right, Onii-chan! Let's go on the trip!

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.030
You mean our honeymoon, don't you?

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:32.450
Let us go, Sasami-san, and begin writing the tale of our love!

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.200
Yay, yay!

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:39.540
Maybe this was a bad idea.

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:47.210
Here are the guides for the trip.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:49.710
Join in the fun!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:53.220
Come on. Say something to Edogawa-san.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:56.300
Tell her how thankful you are that she invited you on this trip.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:56.970
Okay!

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:59.510
Edogawa-san, thank you!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.890
I'll do my best as Tsukuyomi Sasami today!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.230
Don't say that!

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:09.610
Things might be more convenient this way.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:10.780
What?

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.360
Nothing. Welcome!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.610
If everyone is here, let's board the bus!

00:11:15.990 --> 00:11:17.370
Like a herd of cattle.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.450
Yay!

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:19.370
I'll come too.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.370
We don't have a spare seat for you, Sensei.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:25.750
Huh?

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:29.500
Sasami-san!

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:33.010
Two lovers, torn apart by fate!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.760
Oh, Tsurugi-nee's here!

00:11:36.510 --> 00:11:38.970
Tama! What are you doing here?

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.010
Wait, huh?

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:43.470
I see!

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.270
You're doing something fun!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.400
Morning, Tsurugi.

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.270
Oh, a chat room!

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:55.030
Tsurugi-chan joined the chat room.

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:58.030
This was a pretty ingenious idea, Sasami.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:02.290
I thought you'd be getting your pillow dripping wet with your tears by now.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:05.660
Though it'd be just fine if you got dripping wet someplace else!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.670
Why do you always have to make things sexual?

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:13.170
I didn't feel great about leaving Tama behind, so this is perfect.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.170
But be careful.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:18.550
Since you left the power of the supreme god with your mother,

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:20.760
you're defenseless.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:21.930
It's all right.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:25.930
I'm in the safest place in the world right now.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:30.480
Kagamin joined the chat room.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.780
Good for you, Kagami!

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:37.320
She was all sulky and lonely because you weren't coming!

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.410
I was never being sulky!

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:43.080
I was never feeling lonely, either. I was just sleepy.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.830
Morning, Kagami-nee!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:49.580
If you're going to pretend to be Sasami-san, you should call me "Kagami" not "Kagami-nee."

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:50.790
Right!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:51.830
Morning, Kagami!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:55.090
I can't believe you're addressing your elder sister so casually!

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:57.590
Then what am I supposed to call you?

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:04.060
Seems like the cold medicine is getting the best of me.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.600
I can't fight it any longer.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:09.600
I'd hate to miss anything, but I'll have to take a nap.

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.110
Night, Onii-chan.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:15.860
Sasami-san left the chat room.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:17.690
Mamarin disappeared.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.360
I guess she fell asleep.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.570
Think she'll get better soon, Kagami-nee?

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:25.410
As I've already said, you should not call me "Kagami-nee"!

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:27.120
Then what <i>can</i> I call you?

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:29.370
Well then, how about...

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.130
I see!

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:39.630
Onee-sama!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:41.380
Wh-Why...

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:43.890
Why did you just address me that way?

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:47.430
She said this works for both a friend and a big sister!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.020
Is it strange, Onee-sama?

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:52.730
Did I get it wrong again, Onee-sama?

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.270
Am I being a bad girl, Onee-sama?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.860
S-Stop.

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:58.480
I'm going...

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.280
weak at the knees!

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.780
Oh well.

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:08.450
I can't be bothered to suggest anything else, so I'll let you get away with it.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.660
I love you, Onee-sama!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:14.920
She's calling her Onee-sama now!

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:16.750
They're lesbians! Which ones the butch?{Who

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:20.920
Now I can never have her!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.680
Farewell, my first love!

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:26.930
You three certainly are the center of attention.

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.680
Uh...

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:31.680
Sorry. Who are you again?

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:37.440
How cold. I'm the head teacher of the second year at Konohanasakuya Academy.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.610
M-My name is...

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:42.860
K-Kitsunebi Youko.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:48.990
Oh, my bad! I suck at remembering people's names!

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:53.210
This trip should be a great opportunity for us to get to know each other, Yagami-sensei.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.220
Bow to the god!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:13.480
Bow to each other!

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.730
Face each other.

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:20.190
Get ready, and...

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.400
begin!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.700
Let's dig in!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:26.530
Go ahead. Feel free to take the food,
feel free to eat,

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:29.080
and feel free to get fat and regret it all later, peasants!

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:35.330
The goddess who has granted you this freedom is I, Edogawa Jou.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:39.090
Worship me! Call me Marianne!

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:41.920
Do you want to eat with us, Edogawa-san?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.840
Don't you feel lonely on your own over there?

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:46.340
Oh, okay.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.260
What's wrong, Kagami?

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.850
It's all for free, so you should dig in!

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:54.100
She's piqued my curiosity.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:57.350
Is it love? A blossoming love affair?!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:59.110
I like it! Keep going!

